+
+### Experimental
+
+-   `Guide`, `Modal`: Restore accent color themability ([#58098](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/58098)).
+-   `DropdownMenuV2`: Restore accent color themability ([#58130](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/58130)).
